            "source:ac7685ab3c4261fc4e654bba",
            "source:c669ef4a2ad8419c2752ff2d"
          ],
          "text": "Muradin Bronzebeard commands an Alliance gunship crew and meets the Horde with urgent orders to evade and man the guns. He fiercely defends his Ironforge vessel and rallies its crew in battle. Old wounds still drive him to settle his score with Arthas, whom he says he should have beaten when Arthas was young.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 36948
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
